# System-X11 and libx11-compat Grace startup differential capture. The xmgrace
# Motif window plus plot canvas must come up against both stacks, render the
# fixture (axes, curve, symbol, labels), and stay alive. The shared
# common-visible assertion (non-empty + not-all-black) catches a blank-window
# regression on either side; the cross-stack pixel diff is done afterward by
# scripts/compare-motif-reference.py. Startup-only on purpose: the interaction
# and resize replays use synthetic pointer input that routes differently through
# the xdotool (system X server) and internal (compat SDL) backends.
delay 2000
wait-window "Grace" 20000
wait-converge 200 2 50 200 20000
screenshot startup
assert-image startup common-visible.json
assert-image startup grace-canvas-content.json
assert-exit running
